::BeforeSupplyChainCh9
@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

//incoming call
{@Ovill}    Hi Locke. We've had reports of some... uh... unauthorized activity...
{@Ovill}    The... Boron... ppp... PIRATES are charging tolls along our supply routes!

//incoming call - interruption of current call
{@Callie}   Pirates? Oh, how terrifying.
{@Ovill}    How-how did you get this frequency?! This is an encrypted channel!
{@Callie}   Why, it is I...
{@Ovill}    Here we go...
{@Callie}   Callie Lee! The Space Pirate Queen of Velos Station!
{@Player}   Hey Callie. Can't you leave ol' Ovill here alone? He's scared enough of you...
{@Ovill}    This isn't funny! They're taking credits from every shipment that crosses their territory!
{@Ovill}    That's you too, Locke!
{@Callie}   Sounds like a toll to me.
{@Ovill}    It's extortion!
{@Callie}   When Frontier does it, I suppose it's a service fee.
{@Callie}   Anyway, good luck with the pirates, Clackey!

//end call
