::AfterFabrication 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once

{@MAL}      Okey dokeeyyyyyyy CAP-tain!
{@MAL}      Time to submiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii-
{@MAL}      Hi Captiain, how are you doing today?
{@Player}   ...
{@MAL}      Your silence is reassuring! 
{@Player}   M.A.L... after this contract, we need to make a detour. 
{@Player}	Time to have a chat with Keela. 
//should leave player questioning if he is going to find Keela to bug her.  
